#: __init__.py:135
msgid "Treat an open edge that exactly meets an open edge on another object as the interior edge it really is, and judge it by the angle between the two faces like any other. Splitting a part so its pieces each merge is the cheapest way to cut fills, and without this it costs a line down every cut: the halves still touch, but each sees an open border and draws it"
msgstr "将另一物体上恰好相接的开放边视为其真正的内部边，并按两个面之间的夹角像其他边一样判定。拆分部件使各块各自合并是减少填充最省事的方式，若没有此选项，每条切缝都会多出一条线：两半仍然相接，但各自看到开放边界并绘制出来"

