#: __init__.py:265
msgid "Work out true occlusion order per frame using plane tests instead of centroid depth. Costs bake time, nothing at runtime, and stops large floors slicing through objects standing on them"
msgstr "使用平面测试而非质心深度来计算每帧的真实遮挡顺序。会增加烘焙时间，运行时不耗时，并可防止大型地板切穿其上的物体"

#: __init__.py:390
msgid "Write a self-contained .preview.html next to the bake. Double-click it and the animation plays -- scrubber, per-group colours, and a click-to-identify readout. The runtime is inlined, so it needs no server, no build and no network, and it still works emailed to someone else"
msgstr "在烘焙结果旁写入一个自包含的 .preview.html。双击即可播放动画——进度条、按组着色，以及点击识别的读数。运行时已内联，因此无需服务器、无需构建、无需网络，即使通过邮件发给他人也仍可运行"

#: __init__.py:397
msgid "Write the JSON payload indented, one value per line, instead of with every space stripped out. For reading or diffing a bake by hand: it changes nothing a player sees, and costs two to four times the file size -- Lottie the worst of them. Gzip narrows that to well under half, but never to nothing. Ship the compact form"
msgstr "以缩进方式写入 JSON 数据，每行一个值，而不是去掉所有空格。便于手动阅读或对比烘焙结果：不影响播放器所见，但文件大小增加两到四倍——Lottie 最严重。Gzip 可将其压缩到远低于一半，但绝不会归零。发布时请用紧凑形式"

